{"id":"wb-8-751","name":"华亭海塘奉贤段","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"华亭海塘奉贤段","text":"华亭海塘奉贤段，或称奉贤华亭海塘、华亭东石塘、华亭古海塘，是上海市奉贤区柘林镇境内的一处古代海塘遗址，建于雍正年间（1725年至1728年），位于原华亭县南部的古代杭州湾北侧岸线、今沪杭公路和奉柘公路南侧路基沿线，发掘区段长4.5千米，被誉为“上海小长城”。2002年4月，这段海塘被登录为第七批上海市文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%8E%E4%BA%AD%E6%B5%B7%E5%A1%98%E5%A5%89%E8%B4%A4%E6%AE%B5","revisionId":95356105,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95356105","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2dc37274b7d6d29d890ede45.jpg","title":"Fengxianhuatinghaitang.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fengxianhuatinghaitang.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/Fengxianhuatinghaitang.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Fayhoo","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​奉贤华亭海塘 柘林镇奉柘公路南侧 清雍正年间(1725～1728年)","width":320,"height":240}}